{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/fr/reviews/id114128326"}, "name":{"label":"olivier56"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-21T03:00:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.14.0"}, "id":{"label":"13042621757"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome: Simple, Powerful, and Worth Every Cent"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tested more than ten habit-tracking apps over the years. Most of them are too complex, with far too many options and interactions, which in the end makes you lose the motivation to keep using them (you end up spending more time on the app than actually doing your habits — pointless). Here, you get the essentials, with plenty of features that are very well thought out and seamlessly integrated.\n\nThere’s just one element missing that I find essential. You can set a habit to be done X times per day, week, or month. But when it’s set weekly or monthly, there’s no clear indication that you’ve actually achieved the goal. It should be subtly visible when looking at the dashboard.\n\nOf course, I’m giving it 5/5, because even without this feature, the app is fantastic, and I truly hope the developer will continue improving it for a long time.\n\nI’m eagerly waiting for the MacOS version (and maybe one day WatchOS).\n\nGet the Pro version to support and reward the developer’s work. The price is more than fair for the value it can bring to your life!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/fr/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
